<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1878</h1><p class="ref-lede">1878 in world history: 20 events, 31 births, 20 deaths, 2 works, 7 states founded and 1 that came to an end. 956 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
