<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/austro-hungarian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Austro-Hungarian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Austro-Hungarian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Austria-Hungary occupies Bosnia-Herzegovina</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/german-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/German%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>German Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Bismarck's Anti-Socialist Laws target the rising labour movement</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/sulu-sultanate"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Sulu%20Sultanate.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Sulu Sultanate</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Sultan Jamalul Alam grants North Borneo to Overbeck and Dent</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/barotseland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Barotseland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Barotseland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Lubosi, later called Lewanika, becomes Litunga</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/otto-von-bismarck"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Otto%20von%20Bismarck.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Otto von Bismarck</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Abandons the Kulturkampf and, after two attempts on the emperor's life, has the Reichstag pass the Anti-Socialist Laws</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-isandlwana"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Isandlwana.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Isandlwana</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The High Commissioner Sir Henry Bartle Frere gives King Cetshwayo an ultimatum that he could not possibly meet</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/menelik-ii"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Menelik%20II.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Menelik II</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">By the Treaty of Wadara he submits to Emperor Yohannes IV with a stone round his neck and is crowned Negus of Shewa with the Emperor's consent</span></li></ul></section>
